  lines:
  - text: Doctor, you might be interested in this!
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 0
  - text: I just made a very interesting discovery!
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 0
  - text: Do you know which scientific discovery was NOT made at Rockefeller?
    hasChoices: 1
    choices:
    - text: DNA has a double helix structure
      nextIndex: 4
    - text: Advances in therapies against Hepatitis C
      nextIndex: 3
    - text: DNA is the molecule of heredity
      nextIndex: 3
    isEnd: 0
  - text: "Wrong! They discovered that! Incredible, isn\u2019t it?"
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 1
  - text: "Exactly! But they also made some very remarkable discoveries, don\u2019t
      you think?"
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 1
